{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to have a blast with your friends while diving into fierce competition?</strong><br>Enter the colorful and chaotic world of <i>Fluffies</i>! Compete in a series of fast-paced, hilarious mini-games where quick reflexes and a bit of chaos decide who becomes the ultimate champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Multiplayer Mayhem:</strong> Play with up to 4 friends in local or online multiplayer. Each round throws you into a different mini-game full of unpredictable fun.<br>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Chaotic Mini-Games:</strong> Push your opponents off slippery platforms, keep your balance, and stay one step ahead in each intense match.<br>\ud83d\udc64 <strong>Pick Your Fluffy:</strong> Choose your favorite character and jump right into the action!<br>\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Compete to Win:</strong> Perform your best in every round to score points and earn victory. Only one can be the champion!<br>\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Easy to Learn, Fun for Everyone:</strong> Simple controls and quick matches make it perfect for parties \u2014 but there\u2019s still room for skillful plays!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to jump into the party and become the ultimate fluffy champion?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3894380?t=1756732471","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3894380?t=1756732471","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894380/f7ebcd6e11624d3c74ed5e1001bd8369ef907190/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756732471","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894380/f7ebcd6e11624d3c74ed5e1001bd8369ef907190/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756732471","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"descriptio